<title>SWEDEN: Swedish govt supports Nordbanken buyback.</title>
<headline>Swedish govt supports Nordbanken buyback.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said in a statement that the government supported a proposal by Nordbanken to buy back shares worth around 5.0 billion crowns.</p>
<p>Asbrink said in a statement the buyback would improve the health of the bank and also permit the government to reduce its stake in the bank from 65.5 percent to a low of 58 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The government stands by its intention to sell off the entire state holding in Nordbanken,&quot; Asbrink added.</p>
</text>
